{
  "resume": "=== Benjamin Medrano - Resume.pdf ===\nContact \nmedranobenji2006@gmail.com \n(929) 267-6627 \nBronx, NY 10458 \n\nSkills \nCustomer Service \nIntermediate \nBilingualCommunication \nIntermediate \nTechnical Support \nIntermediate \n\nLanguages \nEnglish \nSpanish \n\nBenjamin Medrano \n\nMOTIVATED HIGH SCHOOL GRADUATE | BILINGUAL \nCUSTOMER SERVICE & IT SUPPORT \n\nProfessional Summary \n\nReliable and engaging high school graduate with proven customer service \nexcellence, bilingual communication abilities, and strong organizational \nskills. Demonstrated ability to work effectively in team environments, \nmanage multiple tasks, and maintain professional standards. Eager to \napply communication and service. \n\nProfessional Experience \n\nIntern – Duro Internship    2022-03 – 2022-09 \nR.A.I.N INC CENTER | Bronx, NY \nProvided technical support and organizational assistance in a professional \ninternship setting. \n\n•  Troubleshot hardware and software issues, improving user \n\nexperience. \n\n•  Assisted clients with technical problems, delivering clear and \n\neffective guidance. \n\n•  Organized office inventory, enhancing workspace efficiency and \n\naccessibility. \n\nStudent Intern    2023-05 – 2023-09 \nCrotona International High School | Bronx, NY \nSupported school activities and provided translation services to facilitate \ncommunication. \n\n•  Assisted with Spanish–English translations for students and teachers. \n•  Led group projects, coordinating responsibilities among peers. \n•  Collaborated effectively with classmates, demonstrating teamwork \n\nexcellence. \n\nIntern – Montefiore Einstein Comprehensive Cancer Center    \n2023-11 – 2024-05 \nMontefiore Einstein Cancer Center | Bronx, NY \nSupported administrative and organizational tasks within a healthcare \nresearch environment. \n\n•  Organized office supplies and inventory, streamlining operations. \n•  Assisted staff with technical troubleshooting and administrative \n\ntasks. \n\n•  Contributed to a productive work environment through efficient \n\norganization. \n\nEducation \n\nHigh School Diploma in Leadership, Bilingual Communication, and \nTechnical Skills \nCrotona International High School \n2021 - 2025-06",
